cused on a father\u2019s emotional journey to find his daughter, with professionally crafted cutscenes and in-game storytelling moments.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-Person Immersion</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore detailed, atmospheric environments from a first-person perspective that enhances tension, discovery, and dread.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick-Time Survival Events (QTEs)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense, heart-pounding moments where quick reflexes are the difference between life and death.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotion-Driven Exploration</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every location, item, and puzzle is tied to the character\u2019s emotional past, making exploration meaningful and impactful.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Sound Design</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to keep you on edge, with subtle audio cues, whispers, footsteps, and unsettling ambiance following your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652040/extras/57c53be45f440b202b5c7a3908470a66.poster.avif?t=1748390199\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652040/extras/57c53be45f440b202b5c7a3908470a66.webm?t=1748390199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3652040/extras/57c53be45f440b202b5c7a3908470a66.mp4?t=1748390199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
